              <li>Team pages (<strong>Damen 1</strong>, <strong>HU20</strong> and the rest) started out <strong>empty</strong> and filled in once the data arrived — the title, league and team photo moved out from under the reader. It was by far the largest shift on the site. Title, league, season, birth years and photo are now there from the start, even without JavaScript</li>
              <li>The <strong>language switch</strong> used to empty half of a team page and reload everything, photo included. Now only the labels change</li>
