              <li>With only one of the two open, the card <strong>splits</strong>: the gender being taken gets the green badge and the contact form, the other gets the gold "Team full" badge and the waiting list. Opening both — or neither, which is where every team starts — shows the single "open for players" row exactly as before</li>
              <li>The waiting-list button is now <strong>gold instead of blue</strong>, matching the "Team full" chip next to it</li>
