              <li>Once it passes the card locks rather than disappears: the sign-up button is replaced by "Registration closed", while the date, venue and "Add to calendar" stay — people who already signed up still need those. The card only leaves the page after the course date, as before</li>
              <li>Saving also closes the sign-up form itself, so a late sign-up is genuinely turned away rather than merely hidden — the link from an old email no longer quietly accepts submissions</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

