            <ul>
              <li>The Excel export on a scorer course no longer produces a generic table — it produces SVRZ's own «Schreiberkurs Teilnehmerliste»: the RSK Swiss Volley Region Zürich letterhead, the grey header band and their 13 fixed columns (Kursdatum, Prüfungsdatum, Prüfungsresultat, Vereinsname, Lizenz-Nr., Name, Vorname, Strasse, PLZ, Wohnort, Telefon, E-Mail, Geb. Datum), ready to send on without retyping. The file is always in German — it is SVRZ's form, not our interface, so it does not follow the admin language. The TSV export is unchanged</li>
